{"id":"931430b9099a6def","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-thm-pcf-shelah.md","title":"Shelah's PCF Theorem","display":"thm-pcf-shelah — Shelah's PCF Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-pcf-shelah","aliases":["58-thm-pcf-shelah"],"display":"thm-pcf-shelah — Shelah's PCF Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-pcf.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-pcf-shelah"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-pcf-shelah</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pcf-shelah — Shelah's PCF Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"434af3b8c053a816\" href=\"?note=434af3b8c053a816\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b82cea6742372d50\" href=\"?note=b82cea6742372d50\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-pcf.md\">../batch06/58-df-pcf.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S,\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S,\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcf}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{pcf}:V\\to V\\)</span> is the possible-cofinalities operation from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b82cea6742372d50\" href=\"?note=b82cea6742372d50\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-pcf.md\">../batch06/58-df-pcf.md</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}shelah}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S(A)\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\forall\\mu\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\mu),\\\\[2pt]\n|\\operatorname{pcf}(A)|\\leq 2^{|A|},\\\\[2pt]\n\\exists\\mu\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;\n\\forall\\nu\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;(\\nu\\leq\\mu)\n\\end{array}\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}shelah}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S(A)\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\forall\\mu\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\mu),\\\\[2pt]\n|\\operatorname{pcf}(A)|\\leq 2^{|A|},\\\\[2pt]\n\\exists\\mu\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;\n\\forall\\nu\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;(\\nu\\leq\\mu)\n\\end{array}\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Progressiveness includes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\neq\\varnothing\">\\(A\\neq\\varnothing\\)</span>, regularity of every member of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|&lt;\\min(A)\">\\(|A|&lt;\\min(A)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The last line asserts that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\)</span> has a largest member; it does not identify that member with a fixed successor cardinal without additional hypotheses.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"434af3b8c053a816","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-pcf.md","status":"resolved","id":"b82cea6742372d50","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-pcf.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-pcf.md","status":"resolved","id":"b82cea6742372d50","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{pcf}:V\\to V$ is the possible-cofinalities operation from [[../batch06/58-df-pcf.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S,\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pcf}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}shelah}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S(A)\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\forall\\mu\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\mu),\\\\[2pt]\n|\\operatorname{pcf}(A)|\\leq 2^{|A|},\\\\[2pt]\n\\exists\\mu\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;\n\\forall\\nu\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;(\\nu\\leq\\mu)\n\\end{array}\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"A\\neq\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"|A|<\\min(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pcf}(A)","display":false}],"bytes":1215,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4348","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-thm-pcf-shelah.md|58-thm-pcf-shelah]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["434af3b8c053a816","